theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 20
text = "Instructions


Your mission is to locate the assigned NPC (Non-Playable Character) in the 
area and interact with them in order to complete your objective. Use the 
on-screen joystick to move your character around the environment and 
carefully explore the surroundings until you find the correct NPC.

Once you are close enough to the NPC, an interaction will automatically 
begin. Simply approach them and make sure you stay within range to start 
the conversation. Pay close attention to the dialogue and do not skip any 
part of the story, just click the screen to next the dialogue, 
as the information provided will help you answer the quiz 
questions correctly later in the game.

Take your time reading and understanding the conversation so you 
can successfully complete the mission."
horizontal_alignment = 1

